  who are recipients from the things we do  with our philanthropic arm to our  employees to just other the people we  deal with that keeps me going and one of  the things I believe that you know  everything moves on  and so I don't worry too much about a  legacy or or that sort of thing I just  um  I want to do the best that I can and I  want to do right by the people I come in  contact with you know for a while at  least you know when the day comes when I  move on to whatever the next life holds  right I don't think about me at least  for a while and that's enough  [Music]
 

